{
 "_schema": "Ties a captured screen to the ledger functions it shows. Each rule: match is a case-insensitive regex over 'surface|area|screen|path|title|url' of a screen (capture-library.mjs screens.json), ledger the function ids. Every rule that matches adds its ids. A rule names a screen type, a navigation path or a page kind, never one site's record. skip drops screens that show nothing of the product (an empty area start, a log file). An id a release does not have is reported by the library build. The storefront rules follow the navigation of the standing site the library is captured from (its group pages are named after the function they show); the back office rules follow screen type names and hold for any site.",
 "skip": [
  "^admin\\|[^|]*\\|[^|]*\\|[^|]*\\|[^|]*\\.log\\|",
  "^admin\\|Insights\\|LogList\\|",
  "^admin\\|(Integration|Settings|Assets)\\|(Integration|Settings|Files)\\|(Integration|Settings|Assets)\\|",
  "^admin\\|Settings\\|[^|]*\\|[^|]*Serializer_(Predicate|XmlType|ItemType)_",
  "^admin\\|Settings\\|[^|]*\\|[^|]*Settings_(Cache|ApiExplorer|Database)",
  "^admin\\|Settings\\|ItemFieldList\\|[^|]*\\|(?!Fields)",
  "^admin\\|Settings\\|FieldOptionMetadataList"
 ],
